# Default User Roles

Every installation seeds the roles below. Authorized administrators may customize, extend, or reset role permissions to shipped defaults. All changes are versioned and auditable. Effective access is always limited by the active subscription package (see [subscriptions.mdc](./subscriptions.mdc)).

Users may hold **multiple roles** and **multiple module assignments**. Effective permissions = union of role/module/user grants ∩ subscription package ∩ ABAC scope.

## Shipped roles

| role_key | Label | Default modules (keys) | Default permissions (summary) |
|---|---|---|---|
| super_admin | Super Admin | all active modules | manage within platform scope; still bounded by subscription in tenant contexts |
| tenant_admin | Tenant Admin | all entitled modules for tenant | manage tenant users, modules, config, roles |
| integration_admin | Integration Admin | integrations, reports_audit | view, manage (integrations); view, export (audit) |
| facility_admin | Facility Admin | facility-scoped operational modules | manage within assigned facility |
| hr_staff | Human Resources Staff | hr, access_admin (limited) | view, create, edit, manage (HR scope) |
| operations_staff | Operations Staff | operations | view, create, edit, manage |
| housekeeper | Housekeeper | housekeeping | view, create, manage |
| biomedical_engineer | Biomedical Engineer | biomedical | view, create, edit, manage |
| discharge_planner | Discharge Planner | discharge, ipd, nursing (view) | view, create, edit, approve (discharge) |
| doctor | Doctor | opd, ipd, clinical, triage, lab, radiology, pharmacy, nursing, billing, reports_audit, patient_registry | view/create/edit clinical; request/view lab & radiology; prescribe; view billing/reports |
| dentist | Dentist | dental, opd, clinical, pharmacy, patient_registry | view, create, edit (dental/clinical); prescribe |
| physiotherapist | Physiotherapist | physiotherapy, opd, ipd, patient_registry | view, create, edit, assign |
| radiologist | Radiologist | radiology, opd, ipd | view, report, edit, manage (radiology) |
| radiographer | Radiographer | radiology, opd | view, update, manage (scan performance) |
| sonographer | Sonographer | radiology | view, create, report (ultrasound) |
| pharmacist | Pharmacist | pharmacy, billing (view) | view, dispense, manage (pharmacy) |
| laboratory_technician | Laboratory Technician | lab | view, report, edit, manage (lab) |
| nurse | Nurse | opd, ipd, nursing, triage, lab, radiology, pharmacy, housekeeping, patient_registry | view/update clinical; request diagnostics; manage nursing; create/update registry |
| receptionist | Receptionist | opd, ipd, billing, patient_registry, communications | create, view (queues/billing); manage registry |
| mortuary_attendant | Mortuary Attendant | mortuary | view, create, edit, manage (mortuary) |
| accountant | Accountant | billing, claims, reports_audit, opd, ipd | manage billing/claims; view/export reports |
| support_staff | Support Staff | communications, operations (limited) | view, create (support tasks) |
| patient | Patient | patient_registry, opd, ipd, lab, radiology, pharmacy, nursing, billing, reports_audit | view-own / update-own only |
| visitor_guest | Visitor / Guest | communications (visitor info) | view limited visitor check-in info |

Detailed attribute-scoped actions live in [permissions.mdc](./permissions.mdc). Module keys live in [modules.mdc](./modules.mdc).

## Administration

- Roles are created automatically on system setup.
- Admins may define additional roles mapped to the same permission vocabulary.
- Reset-to-defaults restores this shipped matrix atomically and must leave no user with access beyond role ∩ subscription.
- Frontend and backend must hide/deny menus, components, actions, and workflows for unauthorized roles.
